{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x29b996",
      "back_en": "Ah, true!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalent casual interjection."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29b9cf",
      "back_en": "the supplies then.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragment; 'pois' for 'then' ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29ba3f",
      "back_en": "the mood.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragment matches."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29ba49",
      "back_en": "Lord Haku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29ba87",
      "back_en": "my name.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29bad0",
      "back_en": "formal thanks to you. You arrived just in time.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29be24",
      "back_en": "That goes for you too, Lord Haku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29bf24",
      "back_en": "accompany me somewhere.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29c4f4",
      "back_en": "land with the kamunagi, and how they denied him.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'negaram para ele' ok for denied him."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29c61f",
      "back_en": "You are LATE, Munechika!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Munechika is female; should be ATRASADA."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29c751",
      "back_en": "...I have no objection. He may do as he wishes.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29ca36",
      "back_en": "Oh! What a joyous day! Master Haku! Look upon me,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Eh?' rendered 'Oh!' minor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29ca66",
      "back_en": "Master Haku, and see a visage stricken with",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Archaic tone preserved."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29cae0",
      "back_en": "Ho ho! Behold me, as fight-fit as thou dost",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Incomplete line preserved."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29cb41",
      "back_en": "Oh, how our reunion gladdens me! In truth,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate archaic register."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29cb71",
      "back_en": "thy presence is worth a hundred men and more--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29d244",
      "back_en": "tactics, I disagree.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29d289",
      "back_en": "tactical retreat.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29d476",
      "back_en": "turn tail and run!? Accept such naked SHAME?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29d721",
      "back_en": "sacrifice the lives of our soldiers for pride?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29d7c2",
      "back_en": "primitives, as is the Mikado's will.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29da05",
      "back_en": "one of the Eight Pillar Generals!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e1fa",
      "back_en": "Dekopompo... My duty is to \"supervise\"",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'watching over' as 'supervisionar' ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e22d",
      "back_en": "you. This means cleaning up the mess you leave",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'code for' as 'quer dizer' acceptable."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e2be",
      "back_en": "If necessary, I WILL invoke my",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e2e9",
      "back_en": "authority as marshal and assume control",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e56e",
      "back_en": "yourself, for my plan is brilliantly elegant!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'astoundingly'->'brilhantemente' minor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e63e",
      "back_en": "and elegance. I, Bokoinante, am in awe.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'fico em espanto' slightly awkward but ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e6bf",
      "back_en": "Munechika. You will lead the attack.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e733",
      "back_en": "That said... My abilities are best suited to",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e760",
      "back_en": "suited to defense. Wouldn't you reconsider?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Gender of 'adequado' splits but ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e791",
      "back_en": "That is exactly why. A defender of fortresses",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e7c3",
      "back_en": "should know how best to dismantle them.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e7fd",
      "back_en": "We will cover the rear! You may rest easy knowing",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Cobrireinhos' is a malformed/non-word."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e8d6",
      "back_en": "Ah, erm-- I beg your indulgence! Were we to give",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate archaic tone."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e909",
      "back_en": "Lady Munechika's proposition its due, perhaps...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Word order awkward but meaning kept."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a34b0",
      "back_en": "at that meeting in the first place?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a362b",
      "back_en": "No false modesty. Oshtor himself",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Lord' dropped, minor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a37e6",
      "back_en": "Lord Raiko's hand.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a3969",
      "back_en": "seen Raiko's battlefield style firsthand...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a3bca",
      "back_en": "I see now. Oshtor told me to help Munechika",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a3dcb",
      "back_en": "I have, uh... thoughts on that.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a4175",
      "back_en": "Tuskur will be a long, hard campaign.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a44ff",
      "back_en": "We remain forever by your side, our Master.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a45ec",
      "back_en": "I await good news, then.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a4d07",
      "back_en": "Please. Unless it defies all logic and sprouts",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Beyond defying' became 'unless' (meaning shift); 'sher' typo."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a4d94",
      "back_en": "in the sky, that one time?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a59d1",
      "back_en": "I can hardly imagine you intend to build a",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'making'->'construir' contextual ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6cb7",
      "back_en": "Lord Haku.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6cf4",
      "back_en": "much of your trust...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6d0a",
      "back_en": "But you have. The princess is smiling.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6e25",
      "back_en": "As such, you have my implicit trust.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7196",
      "back_en": "I beg your mercy?",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Beg pardon?' means didn't understand; 'Peço vossa mercê' shifts to begging mercy."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a71d2",
      "back_en": "the loincloths of every soldier in the army.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'sordado' typo for 'soldado'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7270",
      "back_en": "Oh, and us guys donated a few extras too.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a731e",
      "back_en": "No. There's no getting out of this.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7371",
      "back_en": "head looks like an hourglass, are you...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7fb4",
      "back_en": "If we end up encountering someone you know--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'acabamos' should be subjunctive 'acabarmos'; minor."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8126",
      "back_en": "...I just... I hope those two don't show up...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8408",
      "back_en": "Please... don't fight them. Neither of them.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8626",
      "back_en": "of that. Does she know those two...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a86b8",
      "back_en": "I shall see to our most IMPREGNABLE defense!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'INPREGIÁVEL' is not a word; should be INEXPUGNÁVEL."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a86e5",
      "back_en": "Milady Munechika...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a878c",
      "back_en": "Why shouldn't I be? It hardly demands my",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a87c2",
      "back_en": "The pig is exceptionally crafty in matters of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'filth'->'porco' insult ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a87f4",
      "back_en": "deceit. He'd be a fine general, if he",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a882f",
      "back_en": "...But instead he prefers to tighten the noose",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'seeks'->'prefere' slight but ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a885e",
      "back_en": "around his own neck. What folly.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a88a9",
      "back_en": "applicable to fools such as he.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8925",
      "back_en": "to indulge so.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8d9b",
      "back_en": "Loincloth Force One! Onward!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8db8",
      "back_en": "What!? Why are you all kicking me!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8e76",
      "back_en": "Seems the attack on the fortress has begun.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29bb60",
      "back_en": "Hmhm... It's reassuring to hear your calm",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'nonchalance'->'calma' close."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29beec",
      "back_en": "Hm? Yeah.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29bfcb",
      "back_en": "You've doubtless noticed that conditions",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29c0e0",
      "back_en": "They appear from nowhere, cause a",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'raise a'->'causam' contextual ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29c1a3",
      "back_en": "only to fall into a trap.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29c6af",
      "back_en": "Your name was... Haku? Forgive me, it's been",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29c92a",
      "back_en": "I guess it's because I'm more a mercenary than",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29cc76",
      "back_en": "usual. Not sure I can do anything to help",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'say'->'fazer algo' minor shift."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29d03f",
      "back_en": "Bah! This primitive country only managed to hold out",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'backwater'->'primitivo'; added 'resistir' contextual."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29d15f",
      "back_en": "biting at our flanks with these",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'nip at heels'->'flancos' minor idiom shift."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29dad8",
      "back_en": "your ego to--",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29dbd4",
      "back_en": "The tension keeps escalating, reaching the point of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e46d",
      "back_en": "B-Bah! My soldiers didn't know the terrain",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Dropped 'Uzurushan' but line incomplete."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29e53d",
      "back_en": "O-Of course! A SPLENDID plan. Brace yourself",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x29ea8d",
      "back_en": "Very well. If this course pleases you so, let us proceed",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate archaic register."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a39e9",
      "back_en": "To him, war is a game of numbers. Cold",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a404a",
      "back_en": "I understand how you feel, but we can't have the",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a420d",
      "back_en": "Fighting in a territory where the enemy has complete",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a43ea",
      "back_en": "They'd hardly just let us walk in.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a4939",
      "back_en": "If we can, of course.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a4b79",
      "back_en": "Well, if I were them, I wouldn't expect either",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a4e06",
      "back_en": "That, uh...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a50bb",
      "back_en": "My sister and... others of Onkamiyaryu possess",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a5720",
      "back_en": "Yes. It's poisonous raw. Don't leave it out of",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate fragment."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a594c",
      "back_en": "Kuon... I know how we'll get to the other side",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Inferred 'other side' plausible."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a5ac5",
      "back_en": "y'know.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a620a",
      "back_en": "around, needles still in hand.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'circle approach me' lost the verb 'approach me'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a624a",
      "back_en": "I will also set about making new garments for",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a63a3",
      "back_en": "clothing and make your new wardrobe from",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a640a",
      "back_en": "please. Or... we'll talk about this later.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'Or at all' and 'this' dropped, weakening emphasis."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6594",
      "back_en": "I'm starting to get a really bad feeling about",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6623",
      "back_en": "Eh, it's... going. So-so, I guess.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6758",
      "back_en": "...Has anyone pointed out that it's going to hurt",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Lost negative 'nobody' and added 'doer' not in cut source."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6816",
      "back_en": "M-Miss Atuy, please don't joke...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a6df6",
      "back_en": "I sense a kind of greatness in you for that.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a701d",
      "back_en": "...Even so, it's not very clean either.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7232",
      "back_en": "in their hands.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a72aa",
      "back_en": "Yeah?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'tá?' colloquial ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7711",
      "back_en": "Is this...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7b41",
      "back_en": "vinegar.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a7f6d",
      "back_en": "But Tuskur is your home. I don't want to make this",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate fragment."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a839c",
      "back_en": "Yes... I did see the two of them.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'clapped eyes on' rendered casually but ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8aa7",
      "back_en": "We've returned to the foot of the cliff,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2a8b4c",
      "back_en": "It really is floating...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Accurate."
    }
  ],
  "reviewed": 117
}